# Android Aquarium selector. Standalone levels remain independently buildable.
# This file is the Aquarium's tank roster: the menu app's bundle (task build-cd-iff-aquarium-menu),
# the screensaver's LevelCatalog (copied into the Dream's assets by Gradle), the screensaver bundle
# order (scripts/build-aquarium-screensaver-levels.py) and the tests all read it. Add a tank here only.
# Format: `level <file>-standalone.iff | <menu name> [| <Dream label>]`; the id is the file name
# without -standalone.iff; the Dream label defaults to the menu name; cdpack ignores the third column.
# Plan: docs/plans/2026-11-21-aquarium-menu-and-screensaver-launch.md (Phase 2)
title WF Aquarium
prompt Choose a tank
level aquarium-standalone.iff | Clownfish & Sea Anemone | Clownfish
level aquarium_blue_shrimp-standalone.iff | Blue Shrimp | Blue Shrimp
level aquarium_betta-standalone.iff | Calm Betta | Betta
level aquarium_jellyfish-standalone.iff | Jellyfish | Jellyfish
level aquarium_lionfish-standalone.iff | Lionfish | Lionfish
level aquarium_plants-standalone.iff | Planted Tank | Planted Urchin
level aquarium_arowana-standalone.iff | Asian Arowana | Arowana
level aquarium_tiger_barbs-standalone.iff | Tiger Barbs | Tiger Barbs
level aquarium_thai_reef-standalone.iff | Gulf of Thailand Reef | Thai Reef
level aquarium_thai_reef_anime-standalone.iff | Gulf of Thailand Reef - Anime | Thai Reef Anime
level aquarium_sea_stars-standalone.iff | Sea Stars | Sea Stars
